            <p>Signature revision r2: reissues the unchanged 1.7.1.0002 DLL with a separately generated Fluorine7 CPD signature, independently verified with the public key from Windows PixInsight. Replaces the original Windows package whose module signature was invalid.</p>
            <p>Installed under Process &gt; Convolution &gt; AstroDiffraction. Requires PixInsight 1.9.5 on Windows x64.</p>
